# f1sp3d-1 on zerobas: breakpoints on OUR rdabs_body / rdabs_ioerr, the loader's return address $C02C and $CDA3.
# rdabs_body entered with HL = $4DE1 -- the dispatcher's jp (hl) target -- so H = $4D sectors, not 8.
